<title>USA: Crown Casino Q1 July shr up to $1.16.</title>
<headline>Crown Casino Q1 July shr up to $1.16.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.16		    $0.87</p>
<p> Net			 13,621		   10,745</p>
<p> Revs			   NIL			NIL</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Crown Casino Corp.</p>
<p>First quarter figures end July 31.</p>
<p>Figures for Q1 1996 include pretax gain of $14.9 million from sale of company's remaining 50 percent interest in St. Charles Gaming Co Inc in May 1996.</p>
<p>Figures for Q1 1995 include pretax gain of $21.5 million from sale of first 50 percent interest in Charles Gaming in June 1995 and $2.4 million loss representing the company's equity in the net loss of Charles Gaming.</p>
</text>
